/-- Boundary agreements for one compatible shell extension, bundled so the
two deeply dependent carrier equalities are checked one field at a time. -/
structure CompatibleShellAgreements (P Q R S : PolygonalCircle)
    (D : CompatibleClosedDiskHomeomorph P R)
    (hPQ : P.closedRegion ⊆ Q.interiorRegion)
    (E : closedShell P Q ≃ₜ closedShell R S)
